<title>POLAND: Polish BOS soars 65.5 pct on bourse debut.</title>
<headline>Polish BOS soars 65.5 pct on bourse debut.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Poland's Bank Ochrony Srodowiska (BOS) started trade on the Warsaw bourse at 48 zlotys, 65.5 percent above its issue price of 29 zlotys.</p>
<p>BOS is listed on the main market of the bourse.</p>
<p>The price was higher than some analysts expectations of about 40 zlotys.</p>
<p>In November last year investors subscribed to about 13 million BOS shares of the 1.2 million-share initial public offering.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
